Package: motif-on-qt-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: qt6-base-dev, pkgconf | pkg-config, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Motif, Athena, Xt and Xlib C APIs on Qt 6 - development files
 Motif on Qt implements the Xt/Motif C API, and the part of Xlib Motif
 programs use, on Qt 6: Motif programs compile unmodified and run as Qt
 applications, without X11 or libXm. The Athena widgets (libXaw), Xmu
 and the Xpm API are included, so Athena programs and programs that mix
 Motif with Athena widgets build too.
 .
 This package has the headers, the static library, linker scripts and
 pkg-config files for -lXm -lXt -lX11 -lXaw7 -lXmu -lXpm, and the motif-on-qt-env wrapper:
 run a program's build under motif-on-qt-env to build it against Motif on
 Qt.
